  "title": "Malaria Outbreak in Germany: Two Workers Killed, Mosquitoes Detected",
  "summary": "German health officials reported that two workers at Frankfurt Airport died of malaria after mosquito traps and monitoring were set up. The airport is conducting an investigation to determine the cause of infection.",
