    {
      "statement": "Germany's Frankfurt Airport reported two workers infected with malaria after mosquito traps and monitoring were set up.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Mosquito traps were installed at the airport and a mosquito monitoring process is under way to investigate the outbreak.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
