      "title": "Officials urge calm after malaria outbreak kills two staff at Frankfurt airport",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/27/malaria-outbreak-kills-two-staff-at-frankfurt-airport-germany",
      "description": "<p>Mosquito traps are set up at Germany’s biggest airport and doctors are asked to look out for symptoms of disease</p><p>German health officials are seeking to reassure the public after two workers at the country’s biggest airport died of malaria.</p><p>Mosquito traps have been set up at Frankfurt airport and a mosquito monitoring process is under way. A detailed investigation is being conducted to clarify how the workers contracted the disease.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/27/malaria-outbreak-kills-two-staff-at-frankfurt-airport-germany\">Continue reading...</a>",
